cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software

title: "gravi-signal-ml"
abstract: >
  An open-source Python pipeline for unsupervised morphological
  characterization of LIGO/Virgo O4a gravitational-wave glitch data.
  The pipeline applies DINOv2-Reg frozen feature extraction, PCA
  dimensionality reduction, UMAP manifold learning, and Dirichlet
  Process Mixture Model (DPMM) clustering to identify morphologically
  distinct groups of detector noise transients without labeled training
  data. Includes ablation study, stability analysis, time-slide
  background estimation, and in-domain morphological cross-check
  validated with GW150914 (Chirp@0.997).

